:: Fishing Beach Cat Eat Party
<<effects>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.partyFeed to "declined">>
The teens by the campfire go silent as they watch you drop the whole $fishingHookedFish.type in your mouth. <<fishingEatFishTfProgress>><<lstress>><<stress -6>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Beach Party Fish Cook
<<effects>>
You carry the $fishingHookedFish.type over to the teens by the fire. They whoop as one of them pulls out a knife and cleans it as best they can. In a few minutes, it's sizzling over the flames.
<br><br>

You and the others tear into it once it's done. It's messy, smoky, and a little sandy, but it tastes great.<<stress -12>><<llstress>><<status 25>><<ggcool>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Return to Fishing|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Stick around|Beach Party]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Throw Back Party
<<effects>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.partyFeed to "declined">>
You toss the $fishingHookedFish.type back into the sea, ignoring the groans and jeers that rise from the campfire behind you.
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Keep Party
<<effects>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.partyFeed to "declined">>
You stow the $fishingHookedFish.type away, ignoring the groans and jeers that rise from the campfire behind you.
<<tending_give $fishingHookedFish.type 1>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>



:: Widgets Fishing Beach Campfire Party [widget]
<<widget "fishingWaitAmbientCampfireParty">>
	<<addinlineevent 3>>
		You smell smoke wafting from the campfire.
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent 3>>
		You hear laughter from the campfire.
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</widget>>
